# Spike B promisc - the configuration banner, 2026-08-09, nRF54L15 DK.
#
# Recorded from the boot that produced run 6, and kept separately because it is
# what says which register words were programmed. The prefix line is the part
# worth reading twice: eight logical addresses are armed, the real devnum_lo
# (0x17) sits at slot 5, and the other seven are decoys. RXMATCH read 5 on every
# CRC-valid frame of every run.
#

